#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.142.0 — Sysadmin 6: Printing, Email & Integrations
(pass 6 of 8).

Every message and integration has an owner: the email machinery and
sender identity, the queue as the outbound ledger, the communication
map, the integration inventory, credential and API custody, and the
designed failure modes with reconciliation where money and statute
flow. Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_sysadmin_pro.seed_sysadmin_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.141.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

